{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/yubikit\/nfcsmartcardconnection"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"NFCSmartCardConnection","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The  NFCSmartCardConnection is short lived and should be closed as soon as the commands sent to the YubiKey have finished processing. It is up to the user of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the connection to close it when it no longer is needed. As long as the connection is open the NFC modal will cover the lower part of the iPhone screen.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"In addition to the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/NFCSmartCardConnection\/close(error:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" method defined in the SmartCardConnection protocol the NFCSmartCardConnection has an additional ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"close(success:)"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"method that will close the connection and set the alertMessage of the NFC alert to the provided message.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Note","style":"note","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"NFC is only supported on iPhones from iPhone 6 and forward. It will not work on iPads since there’s no NFC chip in these devices."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"NFC connection to a YubiKey (iOS only).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"NFCSmartCardConnection establishes a connection to a YubiKey via NFC. The connection","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"presents the system NFC dialog and waits for the user to tap their YubiKey.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"NFC connections are short-lived due to iOS timeout constraints. Perform operations quickly","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and close the connection with a user-visible message.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let connection = try await NFCSmartCardConnection(","    alertMessage: \"Hold your YubiKey near the phone\"",")","let session = try await OATHSession.makeSession(connection: connection)","let codes = try await session.calculateCredentialCodes()","await connection.close(message: \"Codes retrieved\")"]}]}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Creating a SmartCardConnection to a YubiKey","identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/SmartCardConnection","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/USBSmartCardConnection","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/LightningSmartCardConnection","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WiredSmartCardConnection"],"anchor":"Creating-a-SmartCardConnection-to-a-YubiKey"}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"struct","title":"NFCSmartCardConnection","modules":[{"name":"YubiKit"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"NFCSmartCardConnection","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:7YubiKit22NFCSmartCardConnectionV","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Structure","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"NFCSmartCardConnection"}]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A NFC connection to the YubiKey.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/NFCSmartCardConnection","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit"